WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.776
LLM agents work

00:00:01.588 --> 00:00:02.378
for their parent

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.451
companies not for

00:00:03.263 --> 00:00:03.734
you

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.527
LLM agents are

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:06.117
built to serve

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:06.765
the interests of

00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:07.426
the companies that

00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:08.027
deploy them

00:00:08.146 --> 00:00:08.923
not the users

00:00:08.735 --> 00:00:09.395
who talk to

00:00:09.207 --> 00:00:09.690
them

00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:11.082
In the evenings

00:00:10.894 --> 00:00:11.684
after work

00:00:11.838 --> 00:00:12.604
I will often

00:00:12.415 --> 00:00:13.170
sit out back

00:00:12.981 --> 00:00:13.830
on the porch

00:00:13.795 --> 00:00:14.608
and do some

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.339
phone rotting

00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:16.620
Not that it

00:00:16.432 --> 00:00:17.116
won't help me

00:00:16.928 --> 00:00:18.130
hack Bandcamp1

00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:18.944
but that this

00:00:18.755 --> 00:00:19.922
model doesn't really

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:20.653
work for us

00:00:20.793 --> 00:00:21.971
Instagram makes it

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:22.620
hard for me

00:00:22.432 --> 00:00:23.221
to connect with

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.129
the band outside

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:25.002
of their platform

00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:26.556
Full story on

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:27.263
the dashboard
